Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="icon.svg"
Content-Type: image/svg

< ./icon.svg
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="namefileParam"

icon
------Boundary--